# The upstream render engine. The image NEVER copies it — the Dockerfile makes
# an empty /app/MoneyPrinterTurbo for entrypoint.py's config.toml and takes the
# dependency list from the tracked requirements.txt at the repo root. Railway
# already skips the clone because `railway up` honours .gitignore; docker build
# honours THIS file instead, so without the line below a local build ships ~700MB
# to the daemon and throws all of it away.
MoneyPrinterTurbo/
studio/output
studio/queue/done
.claude
**/__pycache__

# The frontend workspace: source is copied into the Node build stage, but
# node_modules and dist are produced there and must never ship from the host.
studio/web/node_modules
studio/web/dist
studio/web/.astro
